sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant UI as Frontend Workspace
  participant Gateway as API Gateway
  participant Repo as Repository Service
  participant Secrets as Secret Provider
  participant Kafka as Kafka
  participant Indexer as Repository Indexer
  participant Search as OpenSearch
  participant Graph as Knowledge Graph
  participant Audit as Audit Service

  User->>UI: Add repository provider, URL, branch
  UI->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/repositories
  Gateway->>Gateway: Validate token and workspace
  Gateway->>Repo: Create repository
  Repo->>Secrets: Store credential reference
  Repo->>Audit: Record repository.registered
  Repo->>Kafka: Publish repository.registered
  Repo->>Kafka: Publish repository.index_requested
  Repo-->>Gateway: Repository created
  Gateway-->>UI: Repository status: indexing
  Kafka-->>Indexer: Consume index request
  Indexer->>Indexer: Clone snapshot and parse files
  Indexer->>Search: Write file and symbol index
  Indexer->>Graph: Upsert code facts
  Indexer->>Kafka: Publish repository.index_completed
  UI->>Gateway: Poll or stream index status
  Gateway-->>UI: Repository status: indexed
